[1;38;2;25;103;210m  ## Errors / wrong assumptions (must fix before implementing)[m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  [m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  1. **Go version prerequisite is wrong.** Plan says "Go 1.22+". `go.mod`[m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  declares `go 1.25.6` and a `go` directive is a minimum toolchain requirement,[m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  so the README must say **Go 1.25+** (or "the toolchain pinned in `go.mod`").[m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  Also worth naming the single dependency `github.com/creack/pty v1.1.24` and[m[K
