[1;38;2;25;103;210m  3. Rewrite step 3 and the checklist item on Go changes to a baseline-relative[m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  check; explicitly mark `M main.go` and `?? build.go`/`?? build_test.go` as[m[K
[1;38;2;25;103;210m  pre-existing.[m[K
